  "label": "SMH (Shaking My Head)",
  "description": "SMH is an internet slang acronym for 'Shaking My Head,' used to express disapproval, disbelief, or exasperation with a situation or behavior. It is a common emotive expression in online communication and social media, often used to convey a judgmental or critical attitude toward something perceived as foolish, excessive, or problematic. In this meme, it frames the viewer’s reaction to the child’s immersion in technology.",
